    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "For a class of groups M , let L(M ) denote the class of all groups G in which\nthe normal closure ⟨aG ⟩ of any element a ∈ G is contained in M . Let qA be the\nquasivariety generated by a finite nilpotent group A. Can the quasivariety L(qA)\ncontain a non-nilpotent group?                                           A. I. Budkin",
